🤖 2) Agent (multi-step, tool-using brain)
def build_agent():
   prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([...])
   agent_core = create_openai_functions_agent(
       llm=llm,
       tools=TOOLS,
       prompt=prompt
   )
   agent_executor = AgentExecutor(
       agent=agent_core,
       tools=TOOLS,
       verbose=True
   )
   return agent_executor
• Here, agent_executor owns the loop:
• think → tool → think → tool → final answer
• It can call calculator and risk_score multiple times.
The orchestrator uses it in two ways:
• directly (for general queries):
result = agent_executor.invoke({"input": user_input})
answer = result["output"]

• inside the workflow (see next).
